rape methyl ester, at regional storage, diesel, low-sulphur, at regional storage supplies are included. Direct airborne emissions of gaseous substances, particulate matters and heavy metals are accounted for. Heavy metal emissions to water and to soil are included. Tyre abrasion is included.; Geography: Data refers to average transport conditions and kilometric performance of different passenger car categories in Switzerland.
